vendor/brotli/brotli.min.js: the Brotli DECODER of brotli.js 2.1.0
(https://github.com/foliojs/brotli.js) with base64-js 1.5.1, bundled
into one script that sets window.orosBrotli = { decompress, version }.
Used only by designkit/fonts.js to unpack .woff2 font files; loaded the
first time a .woff2 is opened. The encoder is not included.

Built with esbuild 0.24.0 from this entry file:
  import { decompress } from 'brotli/decompress.js';
  globalThis.orosBrotli = { decompress: decompress, version: "brotli.js 2.1.0" };
  npx esbuild entry.js --bundle --format=iife --minify --platform=browser \
    --conditions=browser --legal-comments=none --outfile=brotli.min.js

Three licences apply, all reproduced below:
- brotli.js (the JavaScript port and its packaging): MIT, Devon Govett.
- the decoder sources in brotli.js's dec/ folder: Apache License 2.0,
  Copyright 2013 Google Inc. (a port of Google's Brotli decoder).
- base64-js: MIT, Copyright (c) 2014 Jameson Little.

